## Enforcement & Compliance

### Compliance Check:
We may request proof of:
- Attribution placement (screenshot, URL, etc.) for free tier users
- OR commercial license purchase for white-label users

### Violations:
Failure to comply with attribution or licensing terms may result in:
1. Request to add attribution or purchase license
2. Takedown notices (DMCA for hosted code)
3. Legal action (in extreme cases)

**Most people comply - we just ask nicely if missed!**

